            <div xml:id="d340">

                <pb facs="0428" n="330" sameAs="frus:frus1920v01/pg330"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">723.2515/564: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Chile</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Shea</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >to the Acting Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Paraphrase]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Santiago</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1920-03-17T16:00:00-04:42"><hi rendition="#italic">March 17</hi>
                                [<hi rendition="#italic">16?</hi>], <hi rendition="#italic">1920—4
                                p.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received March 17—1 a.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>30. Suppressed excitement here following report of assault on Peruvian Legation
                    and officials in La Paz. It is believed that Peru will mobilize an army, in
                    which event Chile will mobilize also.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Shea</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
